### Variables (VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP Client)
@base = http://localhost:8000
@token = cambia-este-token-por-uno-largo-y-aleatorio

### Salud
GET {{base}}/health/live

###
GET {{base}}/health/ready

### Texto
POST {{base}}/api/v1/emotions/text
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "text": "Hoy me siento muy feliz", "language": "es" }

### Texto - idioma no soportado (422 UNSUPPORTED_LANGUAGE)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/emotions/text
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "text": "I feel great", "language": "en" }

### Imagen (reemplace la ruta)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/emotions/image
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=B

--B
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="rostro.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./samples/rostro.jpg
--B--

### Video (202 Accepted)
# @name video
POST {{base}}/api/v1/emotions/video
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=B

--B
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="sampleFps"

2
--B
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="video"; filename="clip.mp4"
Content-Type: video/mp4

< ./samples/clip.mp4
--B--

### Consultar video
GET {{base}}{{video.response.body.$.resultUrl}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Multimodal texto + imagen
POST {{base}}/api/v1/emotions/analyze
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=B

--B
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="text"

Estoy muy triste
--B
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="visualWeight"

0.5
--B
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="rostro.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./samples/rostro.jpg
--B--

### Multimodal texto + video (202) -> luego GET /emotions/analyze/{analysisId}
# @name analyzeVideo
POST {{base}}/api/v1/emotions/analyze
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=B

--B
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="text"

Estoy muy triste
--B
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="video"; filename="clip.mp4"
Content-Type: video/mp4

< ./samples/clip.mp4
--B--

###
GET {{base}}{{analyzeVideo.response.body.$.resultUrl}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear sesión de cámara (devuelve sessionId, websocketPath y streamToken efímero)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/emotions/streams
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sampleFps": 2 }

### WebSocket: no se puede probar en .http. Use scripts/camera_demo.py o ver docs/asyncapi.yaml

### Crear sesión MULTIMODAL EN VIVO (cámara + texto mientras se escribe)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/emotions/live
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sampleFps": 2, "visualWeight": 0.5, "visualWindowSeconds": 5, "language": "es" }

### WebSocket de /live: use /demo (tarjeta 6) o scripts/live_multimodal_demo.py; contrato en docs/asyncapi.yaml
